"><div class="column-30"><h3 class="h3">@aug_style Social Media Prowess</h3></div><div class="column-70"><div class="paragraph-700">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia. <br/></div></div></article><article class="row-side-header"><div class="column-30"><h3 class="h3">The Style Shop Personal Artwork</h3></div><div class="column-70"><div class="paragraph-700">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia. <br/></div></div></article></section><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="page-break"><div class="middle-page-break"><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-w-id="3d873315-3907-40fd-11fc-9deed1384f43" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64ca139f5011fbc998841b7d_rainbow-bridge.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div><header id="founder" class="header-subtitle"><h2 class="h2">Sean August Horvath</h2><div class="subtext">CEO and founder. </div></header><article class="row-side-header"><div class="column-30"><h3 class="h3">Building these brands</h3></div><div class="column-70"><div class="paragraph-700">Hi. I&#x27;m happy you&#x27;re here and reading this. </div><div class="paragraph-700">In building this platform, as I watched it come together, my ambition grew the more I leveraged my passion for learning new technology to rapidly scale process, building architecture to serve sought-after, interdisciplinary content across popular mediums of the day. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">Today we work towards becoming a household name, modern, media publishing network. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">This site was developed and was covered in my personal, pre-AI days, digitally created art. While we use a lot of automation, a human hand must stay in the process to reach a nuanced audience with dynamic content. We think of using A.I. as delegating the menial tasks, freeing up time and mental space for high-level conceptual and strategic thinking and work. <br/></div></div></article><article class="row-side-header"><div class="column-30"><h3 class="h3">Background briefing</h3></div><div class="column-70"><div class="paragraph-700">Before August.Styles, I built and managed creating digital and social teams and projects for 9 years, publishing content reaching millions per post; scaling the teams from 2 to 20 with digital footprint growth. <br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">Most recently I was employed as an artist branding a DAO that developed the first ever approved zero knowledge cryptographic privacy layer for Ethereum apps, explaining the products function in a print comic book.<br/></div><div class="paragraph-700">I hope you find something of value from August.Styles and always encourage reaching out through social media or our contact form. <br/></div></div></article><header class="art-divider"><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-w-id="73643a02-8921-2f42-cfd5-840e65a52c22" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header></section><footer style="opacity:0" class="footer"><aside class="form-block"><div class="standard-form-block w-form"><form id="wf-form-302-spectrum-footer-email" name="wf-form-302-spectrum-footer-email" data-name="#302-spectrum-footer-email" method="get" class="footer-form" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d5115f2d" data-wf-element-id="3fde19c5-f26c-ab62-f653-7385adf42474"><input class="form-field w-node-_3fde19c5-f26c-ab62-f653-7385adf42475-d5115f2d w-input" maxlength="256" name="302-name" data-name="302-name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="302-name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="302-email" data-name="302-email" placeholder="Email" type="email" id="302-email" required=""/><input type="submit" data-wait="Trending..." id="w-node-_3fde19c5-f26c-ab62-f653-7385adf42477-d5115f2d" class="subscribe-mint-green w-button" value="Subscribe"/></form><div class="subscription-thanks w-form-done"><div class="message">Thanks, rockstar 💎</div></div><div class="subscription-error w-form-fail"><div class="message">Hm — try that again please? </div></div></div></aside><div class="logo-contact-block"><div class="footer-menu-block"><a href="seanivore-house-llc-brands.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="footer-text">About</div></a><a href="contact.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="footer-text">Contact</div></a><div class="legal"><a href="legal-privacy-terms.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="footer-text">Privacy Policy | Terms &amp; Conditions</div></a></div><div class="copyright">© 2023 August House LLC </div></div><div class="logo"><div data-w-id="3fde19c5-f26c-ab62-f653-7385adf42492" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="logo-animation" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef