ph">Currently, there is a negative energy challenge between the balanced and harmonious Sun in Libra and the dreamy and illusionary Neptune in Pisces. This may bring about confusion, indecisiveness, and a struggle to assert oneself.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">The intense and passionate Sun in Scorpio is creating a quincunx aspect with the impulsive and fiery Moon in Aries. This clash of energies may cause internal tension and a struggle for control. Additionally, the Sun&#x27;s trine aspect with retrograde Saturn in Pisces suggests a struggle with limitations and a sense of restriction. Furthermore, the conjunction between Mercury and Mars in Scorpio intensifies communication and mental activity, potentially leading to arguments and heightened aggression. The opposition between Mars and retrograde Jupiter in Taurus amplifies this tension, resulting in impulsive actions and a tendency to overdo things. The sextile aspect between retrograde Neptune in Pisces and Pluto in Capricorn indicates a subtle undercurrent of power struggles and manipulation. Overall, the current negative energy is characterized by internal conflicts, intense communication, impulsive actions, and power struggles.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header class="section page-break"><div data-w-id="2f1d348e-f911-9afa-ae01-9af2da4a1619" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><h3 id="integrate-difficult-aspects" class="heading astro-planner">Integrating the Difficult</h3><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _20"><h4 id="w-node-_2f1d348e-f911-9afa-ae01-9af2da4a162a-d51160d2" class="subheading astro-planner">Thursday</h4></div><div class="thursday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate this negative energy clash, it is recommended to engage in grounding activities such as meditation or spending time in nature. Set clear goals to maintain focus and direction. Seek advice from trusted sources to gain clarity and perspective. Embrace self-compassion to navigate any feelings of confusion or doubt. Foster critical thinking to discern reality from illusion. By incorporating these behaviors, one can counteract the current negative energy and maintain a sense of balance and clarity.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate the current negative energy clash, focus on grounding activities like meditation and engaging in physical exercise. Setting clear goals and creating a structured routine can help regain a sense of control. Seek advice from trusted mentors or therapists to gain perspective and support. Embrace self-compassion and practice critical thinking to maintain clarity amidst the intensity.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header style="opacity:0" class="bleed-image-header"><div class="thursday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" width="1500" data-w-id="2f1d348e-f911-9afa-ae01-9af2da4a1638" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/652c175b9579c3d31d541c61_2023-10-19-art.webp" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div data-w-id="2f1d348e-f911-9afa-ae01-9af2da4a163a" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg