e-link">Customize</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="start-week-aspects.html#challenging-energy" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Harsh Vibes</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="start-week-aspects.html#integrate-difficult-aspects" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Mitigation</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="start-week-aspects.html#full-week" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Rest of Week</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="start-week-aspects.html#other-readings" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Other Readings</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="start-week-aspects.html#sources" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Sources</div></a></section></div><header class="art-divider"><div class="column _20"></div></header></header><header style="opacity:0" class="bleed-image-header"><div class="monday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" width="1500" data-w-id="8b71f209-b8be-998d-4a70-11488708e58d" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/652c1af5668035544eba7f06_2023-10-16-art.webp" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="column leaf-anim"><div class="logo-anim" data-w-id="76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd150" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9d5cfefe08e9b264708aa_august-style-logo-ui-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></div></main></div></div></div></div></header><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><h3 id="harmonious-energy" class="heading astro-planner">Harmonious Astro-Energy</h3><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _20"><h4 id="w-node-_76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd16e-d5116100" class="subheading astro-planner">Monday</h4></div><div class="monday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">Currently, the Sun in Libra conjunct Mercury in Libra harmonizes communication and self-expression. This energy fosters balanced and diplomatic conversations. The trine of Mars in Scorpio with Saturn in Pisces provides disciplined and focused actions. This energy supports determined and strategic efforts, driven by emotional depth and resilience. Overall, there is a positive flow of harmonious and balanced energy, encouraging effective communication and strategic actions rooted in emotional resilience.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header class="section page-break"><div data-w-id="76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd179" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><h3 id="integrating-positive-energy" class="heading astro-planner">Encouraging the Positives</h3><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _20"><h4 id="w-node-_52c4bca3-ec90-eac3-1d69-3ea4c4d97ea3-d5116100" class="subheading astro-planner">Tuesday</h4></div><div class="tuesday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">Integrate the current positive energy by embracing the playful communication of Mercury in Gemini trine Jupiter in Aquarius. Engage in open-minded conversations, explore new ideas, and expand your knowledge. Embrace the joy of learning and sharing information.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">With the Moon in Sagittarius trine Mars in Aries, there is an energetic and adventurous vibe in the air. Engage in physical activities and pursue your passions with enthusiasm and vigor. Embrace your inner warrior and fearlessly step out of your comfort zone.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">Embrace the empowering energy of the fiery Sun in Aries trine the passionate Mars in Leo. Engage in assertive and bold activities that ignite your creativity and confidence. Express yourself passionately and fearlessly, taking charge of your actions to manifest your desires. Allow your inner fire to fuel your ambitions and lead you towards success.</div></div></div></div></div></section><aside class="cta columns"><div data-w-id="76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd18a" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1f0da194efeea8d9da_radiant-diamond-pair-left.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="2" data-duration="0"></div><div class="cta-form"><h3 id="customize" class="form-cta-header red w-node-_76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd18c-d5116100">Tips Catered to Your Sign</h3><div class="cta-message">We&#x27;ll message you sign-specific ways to deal with difficult energy and encourage positive energy. </div><div id="C1BA33A38-19" class="standard-form-block w-node-_76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd190-d5116100 w-form"><form id="wf-form-C1BA33A38-19" name="wf-form-C1BA33A38-19" data-name="C1BA33A38-19" method="get" class="astro-sms-signup" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d5116100" data-wf-element-id="76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd191"><select id="Reader-s-Sign" name="Reader-s-Sign" data-name="Reader&#x27;s Sign" required="" class="sign-selection-field w-select"><option value="reader-sign">Hey, what&#x27;s your sign 🙂</option><option value="1-aries">Aries ♈︎</option><option value="2-taurus">Taurus ♉︎</option><option value="3-gemini">Gemini ♊︎</option><option value="4-cancer">Cancer ♋︎</option><option value="5-leo">Leo ♌︎</option><option value="6-virgo">Virgo ♍︎</option><option value="7-libra">Libra ♎︎</option><option value="8-scorpio">Scorpio ♏︎</option><option value="9-sagittarius">Sagittarius ♐︎</option><option value="10-capricorn">Capricorn ♑︎</option><option value="11-aquarius">Aquarius ♒︎</option><option value="12-pisces">Pisces ♓︎</option></select><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Name" data-name="Name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="Name-2" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Phone" data-name="Phone" placeholder="Phone" type="tel" id="Phone" required=""/><input type="submit" data-wait="Vibe planning ✅" class="submit-button magenta w-button" value="Subscribe"/></form><div class="subscription-thanks w-form-done"><div class="message">Check your inbox 🪐</div></div><div class="subscription-error w-form-fail"><div class="message">Weird. Try that again, please? </div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="76ac9dc6-a54c-7821-b64b-77990aedd19c" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1fbfd0c5d5d665db1d_radiant-diamond-pair-right.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="2" data-duration="0"></div></aside><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><h3 id="challenging-energy" class="heading astro-planner">Challenging Astro-Energy</h3><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _20"><h4 id="w-node-_982b9c6b-b321-0030-c7f8-27f149aee226-d5116100" class="subheading astro-planner">Tuesday</h4></div><div class="tuesday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">The rational and harmonious energy of Sun in Libra is challenged by the critical and perfectionistic Moon in Virgo, leading to self-criticism, indecisiveness, and difficulty finding balance. Additionally, the idealistic and dreamy influence of Neptune opposing the Moon may create confusion and a sense of dissociation. Take time to ground yourself and focus on practical solutions.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">Currently, there is negative energy stemming from a conflict between the harmonious and diplomatic Sun in Libra and the erratic and unpredictable influence of the Sun quincunx Uranus in Taurus. This may lead to tension, restlessness, and a desire for independence but with a lack of stability or balance. Additionally, the Sun quincunx Neptune in Pisces adds to the confusion and may bring about disillusionment or feelings of being lost. The emotional depth and intensity of the Moon in Scorpio can exacerbate these feelings, especially in relation to the dreamy and ambiguous influence of the Moon trine Neptune. This energy is further intensified by the passionate and assertive Mars in Scorpio trine Saturn in Pisces, creating a push and pull dynamic between taking action and feeling restricted. Overall, this negative energy may manifest as confusion, restlessness, and a sense of inner turmoil.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">The intense and secretive energy of Sun in Scorpio clashes with the dreamy and elusive Neptune in Pisces, creating a negative energy that brings forth deep emotional turmoil, feelings of vulnerability, and the potential for power struggles and manipulation. Trust may be challenged, and there is a need to navigate through this energy with caution and self-awareness. Be mindful of hidden agendas and seek clarity in communication, as Mercury in Scorpio adds intensity to the mix. The presence of Pluto in Capricorn further intensifies the negativity, urging us to confront our deepest fears and transform our approach to authority and power. The retrograde motion of Saturn and Uranus in Pisces and Taurus respectively adds an unpredictable element to the current energy, causing disruptions and challenges to our sense of stability and security. It is essential to stay grounded and find inner strength during this period.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header class="section page-break"><div data-w-id="30b0b29f-40ad-52d9-39d4-9fd21a46c438" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><h3 id="integrate-difficult-aspects" class="heading astro-planner">Integrating the Difficult</h3><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _20"><h4 id="w-node-_85094362-2069-68b0-3820-7e80d46ed5b3-d5116100" class="subheading astro-planner">Tuesday</h4></div><div class="tuesday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate the current negative energy clash, embrace activities that bring structure and organization into your life. Engage in decluttering, planning, and setting clear goals to counteract the indecisiveness and self-criticism. Seek advice from trusted sources and nurture your critical thinking abilities to maintain clarity. Make time for meditation and practices that promote grounding and self-compassion, helping you find balance amidst the confusion and dreamy influences that Neptune opposing the Moon brings.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate this current negative energy, it is advisable to engage in grounding activities. This may include practicing meditation or mindfulness to find inner peace and clarity. Setting clear goals and intentions can provide a sense of direction and purpose, helping to counteract any feelings of being lost or uncertain. Seek advice and guidance from trusted sources, such as mentors or wise individuals, to gain insight and perspective. Embrace self-compassion and practice critical thinking to maintain mental clarity and navigate through any confusion or ambiguity. By focusing on these activities and behaviors, you can work towards mitigating the negative energy and fostering a more balanced and stable state of being.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate the current negative energy clash, focus on grounding activities like meditation and connecting with nature. Set clear boundaries and practice self-care. Seek advice from trusted sources and engage in critical thinking to maintain clarity. Embrace self-compassion and resilience as you navigate through this challenging energy.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header style="opacity:0" class="bleed-image-header"><div class="tuesday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" width="1500" data-w-id="6c04f52d-bbd3-026a-4cf3-0494a823cc8d" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/652349517bd704342e185dd6_2023-10-10-art.webp" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div data-w-id="6c04f52d-bbd3-026a-4cf3-0494a823cc8f" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></main></div></div></div></div></header><div class="section page-path"><header class="path"><a href="../../index.html" class="url w-inline-b