te inner tension and conflict, leading to feelings of unease and a lack of clarity in decision-making.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">Currently, there is a conflicting and tense energy between the balanced and harmonious Sun in Libra and the intense and secretive energy of Sun conjunct Mercury in Scorpio. This may lead to power struggles, arguments, and a difficulty in expressing oneself clearly. Additionally, the Sun&#x27;s square aspect to Pluto in Capricorn further accentuates this negative energy by bringing forth themes of control, manipulation, and obsession. The Moon&#x27;s square to Mars in Scorpio adds an unpredictable and rebellious energy to the mix, leading to potential conflicts, emotional tension, and impulsive actions. Overall, this negative energy suggests a need for caution, self-reflection, and a careful approach to communication and relationships.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header class="section page-break"><div data-w-id="f5d5f8a7-bc03-bb03-bf47-76b1deaf7443" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><h3 id="integrate-difficult-aspects" class="heading astro-planner">Integrating the Difficult</h3><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _20"><h4 id="w-node-_3f8d13bd-517c-fcf3-a3b7-91c09d19a1e7-d5116121" class="subheading astro-planner">Sunday</h4></div><div class="sunday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate this negative energy, engage in activities that promote grounding and stability. Connect with nature by taking long walks or practicing grounding techniques like barefoot walking. Incorporate daily meditation or mindfulness practices to cultivate inner peace and clarity. Setting clear goals and intentions will help to bring focus and direction to your actions. Seek advice from trusted sources or mentors who can provide guidance and a fresh perspective. Embrace self-compassion and self-care practices to nurture your emotional well-being during this time. Additionally, practice critical thinking and discernment to identify and challenge any limiting beliefs or negative thought patterns that may be contributing to the negative energy. By actively engaging in these activities and behaviors, you can lessen the impact of the current astrological influences and find a sense of stability and harmony within yourself.</div></div><div role="listitem" class="column _700 w-dyn-item"><div class="paragraph">To mitigate this current negative energy, it is recommended to engage in grounding activities such as meditation, spending time in nature, and practicing mindfulness. Setting clear goals and boundaries will help to maintain a sense of stability and focus. Seeking advice and guidance from trusted sources can provide valuable insights and support. Embracing self-compassion and practicing critical thinking will help to maintain clarity and navigate through any challenges that may arise.</div></div></div></div></div></section><header style="opacity:0" class="bleed-image-header"><div class="sunday-only w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" width="1500" data-w-id="f5d5f8a7-bc03-bb03-bf47-76b1deaf7462" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/65234940d528f3ff959c69f1_2023-10-15-art.webp" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div data-w-id="f5d5f8a7-bc03-bb03-bf47-76b1deaf7464" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.pro