re</h4></a><div class="paragraph">But what are ruling planets in astrology, exactly, and how can you learn yours and what it means? Each planet has a specific meaning. &quot;Every sign has a ruling planet, and this planet is the most significant planetary influence of a sign,&quot; says astrologer and psychic medium Rachel Lang. &quot;This planet influences how the sign is expressed, and it gives us insights into the personality traits inherent within the sign. To draw those connections, you would …</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="section half-margin w-dyn-item"><div class="subsection-tight left"><a href="https://nypost.com/article/ruling-planet-zodiac-signs/" target="_blank" class="w-inline-block"><h4 class="subheading sources">Ruling planet for each zodiac sign: What it means, how it affects you</h4></a><div class="paragraph">Each zodiac sign has a ruling planet, which influences how someone moves through life. This planet gives insight into the core traits and personality of each zodiac sign. As one is leading the journey through life, you often embody the energy of this planet, as if it is a guardian empowering you to be your authentic self. Technically, a birth chart’s planetary ruler is the one that governs the Ascendant (or Rising Sign) of the individual. If you know your Ascendant, then you’re in luck! If not, you can head over to a handy …</div></div></div></div></div></section><header class="section above-path"><div data-w-id="f5d5f8a7-bc03-bb03-bf47-76b1deaf751c" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><div class="section page-path"><header class="path"><a href="../../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><di