 data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9434d8a60ceb743414e7a_rainbow-arch-menu-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></nav></header></div><div class="section page-path"><header class="path"><a href="../../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../../todays-astrology-readings.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Astrofluenced</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../today/create-positive-life-changes.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Holistic Alignment</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="change-your-outlook.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="path-page">Interpersonal Catalyst</div></a></header></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-7 w-dyn-item"><address class="header section"><header id="w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f3b-d5116126" class="art-divider"><div class="header-ui" data-w-id="90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f3c" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d4bace5a342dfc11a2c8_center-focused-ivy-growth-ui-page-break-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></header><header id="w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f3d-d5116126" class="title-block"><div id="w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f3e-d5116126" class="title-subtitle-group center"><h1 class="title">Harmonious Connections: Astro Energies for Authentic Relationships</h1><div class="row-flex vert"><div class="subtitle">Astrological Energy week of</div><div class="subtitle">October 2, 2023</div></div></div><div class="summary center"><div class="summary">Improve life through external means; day-to-day social interactions. This is all about your external world. Here’s what is Astrologically possible this week — and how to do it. This is the second reading in a Holistic Alignment trio. <br/></div></div><section class="in-page-links"><a href="change-your-outlook.html#healthy-relationships" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Healthy Relationships</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="change-your-outlook.html#professional-pursuits" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Career Bonds</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="change-your-outlook.html#taking-action" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Taking Action</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="change-your-outlook.html#final-reading" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Final Reading</div></a></section></header><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" width="1500" data-w-id="add32c2c-7c15-428f-3879-7060f5eb3f42" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/6519dcb1b1dcac41b5abeec1_10-02-2023-external.webp" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="column logo-anim"><div class="logo-anim" data-w-id="add32c2c-7c15-428f-3879-7060f5eb3f45" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9d5cfefe08e9b264708aa_august-style-logo-ui-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></div></main></div></address><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="healthy-relationships" class="header-subtext-group alignment-reading"><h2 class="heading alignment-reading"> Healthy Social Bonds</h2><div class="subtext alignment-reading">Trust, empathy &amp; boundaries create foundation for meaningful relations.</div></header><article class="subsection"><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _30"><h3 class="subheading alignment-reading">Building Strong Relationships</h3></div><div class="column _60"><p class="paragraph">The Venus sextile Mars aspect in Leo ♌️ and Libra ♎️ encourages harmonious romantic connections and passionate partnerships. By blending the fire of passion with the balance of diplomacy, individuals can foster healthier relationships. This aspect promotes open communication, increased intimacy, and sparks creative collaboration. Expect exciting dates, shared adventures, and a renewed sense of love and connection. Embrace this energy to cultivate a thriving love life and build stronger bonds with loved ones.</p></div></div></article></section><header style="opacity:0" class="section"><div data-w-id="90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f6e" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="professional-pursuits" class="header-subtext-group alignment-reading"><h2 class="heading alignment-reading">Professional Pursuits</h2><div class="subtext alignment-reading">Energy leading towards stability, recognition &amp; support.</div></header><article class="subsection"><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _30"><h3 class="subheading alignment-reading">Engaging Career Collaboration</h3></div><div class="column _60"><p class="paragraph">The Mercury trine Pluto aspect in Virgo ♍️ and Capricorn ♑️ Rₓ fosters transformative collaborations in career and personal development. By integrating the analytical and perceptive qualities of Mercury with the powerful and transformative energy of Pluto, individuals can dive deep into research, problem-solving, and strategy-building. This aspect enhances communication skills, promotes innovation, and empowers individuals to make impactful changes in their professional lives. Embracing this energy can lead to career advancement, increased confidence, and a greater sense of purpose. Expect breakthroughs, meaningful collaborations, and positive life changes through the integration of this energy.</p></div></div></article></section><aside class="cta columns"><div id="w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f7e-d5116126" data-w-id="90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f7e" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1f0da194efeea8d9da_radiant-diamond-pair-left.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="2" data-duration="0"></div><div class="cta-form"><h2 id="C1BA33A38-5" class="form-cta-header yellow w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f80-d5116126">Personalized Messages</h2><div class="cta-message">We&#x27;ll send you weekly integration tactics for Holistic Alignment of your zodiac sign.</div><div id="C1BA33A38-9" class="standard-form-block w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f84-d5116126 w-form"><form id="wf-form-C1BA33A38-9" name="wf-form-C1BA33A38-9" data-name="C1BA33A38-9" method="get" class="astro-sms-signup" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d5116126" data-wf-element-id="90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f85"><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Name" data-name="Name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="Name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Phone" data-name="Phone" placeholder="Phone" type="tel" id="Phone" required=""/><select id="Reader-s-Sign" name="Reader-s-Sign" data-name="Reader&#x27;s Sign" required="" class="sign-selection-field w-select"><option value="">What&#x27;s your sign?</option><option value="1-aries">Aries ♈︎</option><option value="2-taurus">Taurus ♉︎</option><option value="3-gemini">Gemini ♊︎</option><option value="4-cancer">Cancer ♋︎</option><option value="5-leo">Leo ♌︎</option><option value="6-virgo">Virgo ♍︎</option><option value="7-libra">Libra ♎︎</option><option value="8-scorpio">Scorpio ♏︎</option><option value="9-sagittarius">Sagittarius ♐︎</option><option value="10-capricorn">Capricorn ♑︎</option><option value="11-aquarius">Aquarius ♒︎</option><option value="12-pisces">Pisces ♓︎</option></select><input type="submit" data-wait="You are astro-wise" class="submit-button blue w-button" value="Subscribe"/></form><div class="subscription-thanks w-form-done"><div class="message">Check your inbox 🪐</div></div><div class="subscription-error w-form-fail"><div class="message">Weird. Try that again, please? </div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f90-d5116126" data-w-id="90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9f90" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1fbfd0c5d5d665db1d_radiant-diamond-pair-right.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="2" data-duration="0"></div></aside><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="taking-action" class="header-subtext-group alignment-reading"><h2 class="heading alignment-reading">Make It Happen</h2><div class="subtext">Activities to embrace integration of the aspects &amp; develop an external-life catalyst.</div></header><article class="subsection"><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _30"><h3 class="subheading alignment-reading">Taping Into The Energy</h3></div><div class="column _60"><p class="paragraph">To harness the identified astrological energies, readers can engage in activities that align with the archetypal qualities of the planets and aspects at play. With the Moon in Taurus ♉️ trine Saturn ♄ in Pisces ♓️ Rₓ, individuals can cultivate a sense of grounding and emotional stability by connecting with nature through activities like gardening or hiking. Practice patience and responsibility by committing to a long-term project or setting achievable goals. When Venus ♀ is in Leo ♌️ sextile Mars ♂ in Libra ♎️, channel the fiery energy through activities such as dance or theater, fostering self-expression and assertiveness. Engage in collaborative projects or assertive communication, ensuring a balance between individual desires and harmonious partnerships. By embracing these activities and embodying the qualities of the astrological elements, readers can cultivate positive change and tap into their true potential.</p></div></div></article></section><header class="section page-break"><div data-w-id="d3d9c26d-6d5d-fa6f-3c22-a05598814aaf" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><div style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="final-reading" class="header-subtext-group alignment-reading"><h2 class="heading alignment-reading">Complete Holistic Alignment</h2><div class="subtext alignment-reading">Next balance your inner world with the external world in this reading series trio.</div></header><div class="subsection center"><div class="_2-column center _900"><a id="w-node-_90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9fac-d5116126" data-w-id="90f6ef63-9a7a-970e-ce3c-d9e9a2aa9fac" href="internal-external-personal-growth.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h3 class="subheading alignment-reading v2">Aligned &amp; Thriving: Empowered Change through Astrological Synergy</h3><div class="crop"><img loading="lazy" alt="Two androids relax at a spa. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/6519dcb1b1dcac41b5abeed7_10-02-2023-alignment.webp"/></div></a><a id="w-node-_90