s="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="chart-analysis-monday-10-16-2023%3F79bf6db2_page=1.html#personalize" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Personalize</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="chart-analysis-monday-10-16-2023%3F79bf6db2_page=1.html#archive" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Full Week</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="chart-analysis-monday-10-16-2023%3F79bf6db2_page=1.html#archive" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Archives</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="chart-analysis-monday-10-16-2023%3F79bf6db2_page=1.html#other-readings" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Other Readings</div></a><div class="in-page-link">  •  </div><a href="chart-analysis-monday-10-16-2023%3F79bf6db2_page=1.html#sources" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Sources</div></a></section></div></header><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="eager" width="1500" data-w-id="2841bef1-3c15-d2f6-4b85-0c1617cb15b2" alt="Contemporary digital art illustrating the overall message or theme or mood of this daily astrology chart reading, created for this article. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/652c1af5668035544eba7f06_2023-10-16-art.webp" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="column logo-anim"><div class="logo-anim" data-w-id="2841bef1-3c15-d2f6-4b85-0c1617cb15b5" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9d5cfefe08e9b264708aa_august-style-logo-ui-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></div></main></div><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="row-flex _00"><h3 class="extra-bold green large">Monday</h3><h3 class="extra-bold green large">&#x27;s Chart</h3></div><div class="_2-column"><div class="column _50"><img alt="Astrology chart for reading and analysis today. " loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/652c1af5668035544eba7f24_2023-10-16-1400-gmt-monday-astrology-chart.webp" class="today-astrological-chart"/></div><div class="column daily-readings planets"><div class="subsection"><h4 class="normal blue left">Planet Positions</h4><div class="paragraph todays-positions-aspects">Sun ☉ in Libra ♎️
