400-gmt-monday-astrology-chart.webp" class="today-astrological-chart"/></div><div class="column daily-readings planets"><div class="subsection"><h4 class="normal blue left">Planet Positions</h4><div class="paragraph todays-positions-aspects">Sun ☉ in Libra ♎️
