class="column _50"><img alt="Astrology chart for reading and analysis today. " loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/6523494ffe68096810f286f1_2023-10-11-1400-gmt-wednesday-astrology-chart.webp" class="today-astrological-chart"/></div><div class="column daily-readings planets"><div class="subsection"><h4 class="normal blue left">Planet Positions</h4><div class="paragraph todays-positions-aspects">Sun ☉ in Libra ♎️
