ie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64caa237a47b190a732ddbef_jungle-leaf-art-deco-animated-heading-callout-UI.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></div><div class="column horoscope body"><div class="subsection horoscope body"><h3 class="subheading horoscope v2">Aries: Assertive Passions Ignite New Desires</h3><h4 class="subheading horoscope v3">Venus</h4><div class="paragraph horoscope">Aries, with Venus in Leo, love is fiery and dynamic for you. This energy ignites passion and brings out your bold and confident nature. However, be cautious of the quincunx aspect between Venus and Neptune, as it may create some confusion in matters of the heart. Stay true to yourself and communicate openly to avoid misunderstandings. Trust your instincts, and this energy will bring exciting and transformative experiences in love. Embrace your adventurous spirit and let love guide you on a thrilling journey.</div><h4 class="subheading horoscope v3">Mars</h4><div class="paragraph horoscope">Aries, with the current energy of Mars in Libra ♎️ and significant aspects influencing lust, your passions and desires may be influenced by a need for balance and harmony in your relationships. Mars in Libra ♎️ pushes you to seek partnerships with equal give and take, while aspects like the Venus ♀️ sextile Mars ♂️- bring sensual and passionate energy. Embrace this energy to cultivate harmonious connections and pursue your desires with confidence and grace.</div></div></div></div></section><aside class="cta columns"><div id="w-node-_9c4b048e-4a92-2daf-fbff-516ff6de4852-29c9b959" class="_3-columns tight"><div id="w-node-_7906ccda-4187-5307-16cb-beab2f1f6141-29c9b959" class="column _30"><div id="w-node-_47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d60-29c9b959" data-w-id="47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d60" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website