e for Sunday</h2><div class="subtext centered">A good day for a horoscope. </div></div></div><div class="_2-column _900"><div class="column _25 mobile"><div data-w-id="21ccd60e-2f35-5c26-38aa-702a101cfc43" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64caa237a47b190a732ddbef_jungle-leaf-art-deco-animated-heading-callout-UI.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="column _75"><h3 class="extra-bold green center">Capricorn: Navigating Ambitious Emotion through Cosmic Harmony.</h3><div class="paragraph">Capricorn, the current energy influencing your creativity reflects a harmonious blend of practicality and ambition. With the Sun in Libra quincunx Jupiter in Taurus, you may find yourself redefining your goals to align with your true passions. The sextile between the Moon in Leo and Mercury in Libra enhances your self-expression and ability to communicate your ideas. Embrace the sextile between Venus in Leo and Mars in Libra, as it amplifies your artistic endeavors and allows for a balanced approach. Trust your intuition as you navigate the opposition between Venus in Leo and Saturn in Pisces, which highlights the importance of discipline in your creative process. The quincunx aspect between Venus in Leo and Pluto in Capricorn encourages you to transform and explore new creative territories. Remember to incorporate your imaginative side with the quincunx aspect between Mars in Libra and Neptune in Pisces. Lastly, the square between Mars in Libra and Pluto in Capricorn invites you to channel your inner power and determination into your creative projects. Embrace the supportive sextile between Neptune in Pisces and Pluto in Capricorn, which helps you tap into your subconscious and reveal hidden creative depths. Now is the time to manifest your artistic visions with confidence and determination, Capricorn.</div></div></div></section></div><aside class="cta columns"><div id="w-node-_47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d60-11e8c93b" data-w-id="47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d60" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64daf55b19c92a97ddd08337_left-peacock-fan.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div><div class="cta-form"><h3 id="customize" class="form-cta-header yellow w-node-_47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d62-11e8c93b">Horoscope Texts</h3><div class="cta-message">Rather get these via text everyday? Its forever-free for who all &#x27;VIP&#x27; aka those who subscribe before the end of 2023. </div><div id="C1BA33A38-137" class="standard-form-block w-node-_47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d66-11e8c93b w-form"><form id="wf-form-C1BA33A38-137" name="wf-form-C1BA33A38-137" data-name="C1BA33A38-137" method="get" class="astro-sms-signup" data-wf-page-id="651628a45eed175c11e8c93b" data-wf-element-id="47b091ad-5846-473f-cdaa-bb9056db0d67"><select id="Reader-s-Sign-4" name="Reader-s-Sign" data-name="Reader&#x27;s Sign" required="" class="sign-selection-field w-select"><option value="reader-sign">Hey, what&#x27;s your sign 🙂</option><option value="1-aries">Aries ♈︎</option><option value="2-taurus">Taurus ♉︎</option><option value="3-gemini">Gemini ♊︎</option><option value="4-cancer">Cancer ♋︎</option><option value="5-leo">Leo ♌︎</option><option value="6-virgo">Virgo ♍︎</option><option value="7-libra">Libra ♎︎</option><option value="8-scorpio">Scorpio ♏︎</option><option value="9-sagittarius">Sagittarius ♐︎</option><option value="10-capricorn">Capricorn ♑︎</option><option value="11-aquarius">Aquarius ♒︎</option><option value="12-pisces">Pisces ♓︎</option></select><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Name" data-name="Name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="Name-4" required=