alligraphic-spiral-diamond.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></div><div class="column _60"><div class="subtitle featured">This 3-reading series, posted weekly, collectively helps actualize positive life changes by bringing internal &amp; external worlds into sync. Find wellness &amp; success, guided by Astrology.</div></div><div class="column _20"><div class="header-ui" data-w-id="f2a90cb8-b247-b107-93a7-428777398aa5" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64dae6a8ca772baa81f62fbd_calligraphic-spiral-diamond.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></div></div></div></header></address><div class="column _60 spacers"><div class="section no-gap alignment-feature"><div class="subsection alignment-feature"><div class="column alignment-feature"><h2 class="heading alignment-feature">Personal Growth from Introspection</h2><div class="paragraph alignment-feature">Tap into transformative energies for growth: Grounding with Moon in Taurus, passion through Venus sextile Mars, and introspection via Mercury trine Pluto. Ignite personal power and embrace positive change. </div><div class="paragraph alignment-feature">When our ruler of thought and speech, Mercury, is in Virgo and opposing dreamy Neptune in equally dreamier home of Pisces, our ability for finding clarity is challenged. It can become difficult to discern the truth to navigate challenges in life. The fact that Neptune is retrograde in Pisces only amplifies this. </div></div></div><div class="column alignment-feature-image"><a href="../improve-life/growth-through-introspection.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="header-subtext-group"><h3 class="subheading alignment-feature">Internal Catalysts</h3><div class="subtext alignment-feature">Reading Series Part 1</div></div><img loading="lazy" alt="Figure lost in fog on a red planet. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/6519dcb1b1dcac41b5abeebd_10-02-2023-internal.webp"/></a></div></div><div class="section alignment-feature"><div class="subsection"><div class="column alignment-feature"><h2 class="heading alignment-feature">Positive Change from Social Life</h2><div class="paragraph alignment-feature">Embrace the harmonious energy of Venus sextile Mars &amp; Mercury trine Pluto for authentic connections, transformative conversations, and personal growth.</div><div class="paragraph alignment-feature">Challenging energy includes Moon 🌙 square Mars ♂, Venus ♀ square Uranus ♅, and Mercury ☿ quincunx Saturn ♄. Handling conflicts and unexpected disruptions requires patience and open-mindedness. Navigating communication challenges with empathy and understanding is crucial for maintaining relationships during this time. Remember to stay flexible and adaptable to overcome obstacles and foster personal growth. #Astrology #InterpersonalChallenges</div></div></div><div class="column alignment-feature-image"><a href="../improve-life/change-your-outlook.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="header-subtext-group"><h3 class="subheading alignment-feature">Interpersonal Catalysts</h3><div class="subtext alignment-feature">Reading Series Part 2</div></div><img loading="lazy" alt="Group of people celebrate at a cocktail bar in a futuristic city. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/6519dcb1b1dcac41b5abeec1_10-02-2023-external.webp"/></a></div></div><div class="section alignment-feature"><div class="subsection"><div class="column alignment-feature"><h2 class="heading alignment-feature">Immersive Life Development</h2><div class="paragraph alignment-feature">Coupling the identified astrologically-emphasized internal and external world energies for balance and holistic alignment. </div><div class="paragraph alignment-feature">Turning energetic opportunities into catalysts that are prepped to trigger significant positive life changes that lead to personal success. </div></div></div><div class="column alignment-feature-image"><a href="../improve-life/internal-external-personal-growth.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="header-subtext-group"><h3 class="subheading alignment-feature">Holistic Alignment</h3><div class="subtext alignment-feature">Reading Series Final Part</div></div><img loading="lazy" alt="Two androids relax at a spa. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/6519dcb1b1dcac41b5abeed7_10-02-2023-alignment.webp"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><section id="astro-fashion" class="cta columns"><div data-w-id="b0a6023e-b7ea-27f4-fae1-c20b4024f401" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1f0da194efeea8d9da_radiant-diamond-pair-left.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div><div class="cta-form"><h3 id="w-node-b0a6023e-b7ea-27f4-fae1-c20b4024f403-d51160de" class="form-cta-header yellow"> Life-Changing Inbox</h3><div class="cta-message">Sign up for multiple reading types you&#x27;d like to receive as you browse — we&#x27;re making sure you only receive relevant and interesting mail, for you. <br/></div><div id="1902-astro-page-email" class="standard-form-block w-node-b0a6023e-b7ea-27f4-fae1-c20b4024f408-d51160de w-form"><form id="wf-form-C1BA33A38-14" name="wf-form-C1BA33A38-14" data-name="C1BA33A38-14" method="get" class="spectrum-updates-email" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d51160de" data-wf-element-id="b0a6023e-b7ea-27f4-fae1-c20b4024f409"><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Name" data-name="Name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="Name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="Email" data-name="Email" placeholder="