on" data-w-id="94e12e08-f8a6-45ce-64bf-9fc39ec3a3d3" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9434d8a60ceb743414e7a_rainbow-arch-menu-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></nav></header></div><address style="opacity:0" class="header-section"><header id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd503-d511608f" class="path"><a href="../../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../../the-style-spectrum.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Style Spectrum</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="art-deco-visual-timeline.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="path-page">Art Deco</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="art-deco-visual-timeline.html#timeline" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Visual Timeline</div></a></header><header id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd516-d511608f" class="title-block"><h1 class="title w-dyn-bind-empty"></h1></header><section class="summary-block"><section class="callout"><div class="teaser"></div><h2 id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd525-d511608f" class="h2">Art Deco: Paris&#x27;s Glamour Went Global</h2><p class="paragraph-700">Art Deco art movement takes you from Parisian opulence to eventual global legacy. This defined the Roaring Twenties. </p></section><section class="in-page-links"><a href="art-deco-visual-timeline.html#body-01" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Art Deco&#x27;s Glamorous Debut</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="art-deco-visual-timeline.html#body-02" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">The Pinnacle of Deco Drama</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="art-deco-visual-timeline.html#body-03" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Deco&#x27;s Diverse Denouement</div></a></section></section><header id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd54b-d511608f" class="break"><div data-w-id="a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd54c" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="header-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d4bace5a342dfc11a2c8_center-focused-ivy-growth-ui-page-break-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></header></address><article id="body-01" class="section body-part"><h3 class="h3">Emergence of a Design Style</h3><div class="body-portion"><h4 id="w-node-ecda73c2-4ab9-e7d5-5079-5d39469ed78f-d511608f" class="h4-2">Art Deco&#x27;s Glamorous Debut</h4><div class="paragraph-list w-richtext"><h2>What’s a Rich Text element?</h2><p>The rich text element allows you to create and format headings, paragraphs, blockquotes, images, and video all in one place instead of having to add and format them individually. Just double-click and easily create content.</p><h4>Static and dynamic content editing</h4><p>A rich text element can be used with static or dynamic content. For static content, just drop it into any page and begin editing. For dynamic content, add a rich text field to any collection and then connect a rich text element to that field in the settings panel. Voila!</p><h4>How to customize formatting for each rich text</h4><p>Headings, paragraphs, blockquotes, figures, images, and figure captions can all be styled after a class is added to the rich text element using the &quot;When inside of&quot; nested selector system.</p></div></div><div class="art-history"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d2309f5c03382b744e9_full.andre-mare-louis-sue-cubist-pavilion-mixed-media-installation-paris-1925.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="André Mare and Louis Süe, &quot;Cubist Pavilion&quot;, Mixed media installation, Paris, 1925." sizes=