m/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64ca139f5011fbc998841b7d_rainbow-bridge.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></section><div class="reading-category"><h4 id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd62f-d511608f" class="h4-2">» Daily Chart Analysis</h4><div id="w-node-e7a2a814-0b56-273f-467e-391db667034c-d511608f" class="daily-charts"><div id="w-node-e7a2a814-0b56-273f-467e-391db667034d-d511608f" class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div></div></div><section class="boarder-ui"><div class="divider" data-w-id="a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd673" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9eb594fc24b0a1d62b26b_geometric-ground-plant-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="2" data-duration="0"></div></section></section><section style="opacity:0" class="sources"><h3 id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd675-d511608f" class="h3">Sources</h3><div class="source"><a href="https://www.designboom.com/architecture/mashambas-skyscraper-africa-winner-evolo-2017-skyscraper-competition-pawel-lipinski-mateusz-frankowski-04-12-2017/" target="_blank" class="source-hyperlinked-page-title w-inline-block"><h4 class="source-website">mashambas skyscraper for africa wins eVolo 2017 skyscraper competition</h4></a><p id="w-node-_379e95df-2652-9a31-4fa4-afd5baeb2f50-d511608f">Using architecture to improve the lives of small farmers is one of the main objectives of ‘mashambas’. the winning eVolo competition scheme would serve as a mobile educational center, erected in the poorest areas of the continent. training, fertilizer, and seeds would be distributed from there to the small farmers …</p></div><div class="source"><a href="https://metropolismag.com/viewpoints/what-is-and-is-not-biophilic-design/" target="_blank" class="source-hyperlinked-page-title w-inline-block"><h4 class="source-website">What Is and Is Not Biophilic Design?</h4></a><p>Since today’s “natural habitat” is largely the built environment, where we now spend 90% of our time, biophilic design seeks to satisfy our innate need to affiliate with nature in modern buildings and cities. Thus, the fundamental goal of biophilic design is to create good habitat for people as biological organisms …</p></div><div class="source"><a href="https://www.sageglass.com/industry-insights/seven-principles-biophilic-design" target="_blank" class="source-hyperlinked-page-title w-inline-block"><h4 class="source-website">Seven Principles of Biophilic Design</h4></a><p>Maximizing natural light benefits people as well as energy bills, but biophilic interventions incorporate natural lighting from diffusion to temporal changes. A lighting system that either naturally or artificially changes throughout the day to mimic our circadian rhythm helps link people to the outdoor environment and, …</p></div></section><footer style="opacity:0" class="footer"><aside class="form-block"><div id="1602-spectrum-footer-timeline-email" class="standard-form-block w-form"><form id="wf-form-" name="wf-form-" data-name="#1602-spectrum-footer-timeline-email" method="get" class="footer-form" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d511608f" data-wf-element-id="a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd68e"><input class="form-field w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd68f-d511608f w-input" maxlength="256" name="1602-name" data-name="1602-name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="1602-name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="1602-email" data-name="1602-email" placeholder="Email" type="email" id="1602-email" required=""/><input type="submit" data-wait="Trending..." id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd691-d511608f" class="subscribe-maroon w-button" valu