ulti-storey car park in Welbeck Street, London W1. …</p></div><div class="source"><a href="http://www.voicesofeastanglia.com/2011/08/the-rise-and-fall-of-brutalist-architecture.html" target="_blank" class="source-hyperlinked-page-title w-inline-block"><h4 class="source-website">The Rise and Fall of Brutalist Architecture</h4></a><p>Looking back to the 1950s and 60s many of the new public buildings that were commissioned in the UK were designed in the Brutalist style. The authorities had to rebuild a war-ravaged Britain quickly and to a restricted budget. They wanted a solution that looked modern and forward-thinking and that fitted with the …</p></div></section><footer style="opacity:0" class="footer"><aside class="form-block"><div id="1602-spectrum-footer-timeline-email" class="standard-form-block w-form"><form id="wf-form-" name="wf-form-" data-name="#1602-spectrum-footer-timeline-email" method="get" class="footer-form" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d511608f" data-wf-element-id="a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd68e"><input class="form-field w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd68f-d511608f w-input" maxlength="256" name="1602-name" data-name="1602-name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="1602-name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="1602-email" data-name="1602-email" placeholder="Email" type="email" id="1602-email" required=""/><input type="submit" data-wait="Trending..." id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd691-d511608f" class="subscribe-maroon w-button" value="Subscribe"/></form><div class="subscription-thanks w-form-done"><div class="message">Thanks, rockstar 💎</div></div><div class="subscription-error w-form-fail"><div class="message">Hm — try that again please? </div></div></div></aside><div class="logo-contact-block"><div class="footer-menu-block"><a href="brutalism-visual-timeline.html#" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="footer-text">About</div></a><a href="../../about/contact.html" class="url w-inline-bloc