n" data-w-id="94e12e08-f8a6-45ce-64bf-9fc39ec3a3d3" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c9434d8a60ceb743414e7a_rainbow-arch-menu-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></nav></header></div><address style="opacity:0" class="header-section"><header id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd503-d511608f" class="path"><a href="../../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../../the-style-spectrum.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Style Spectrum</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="pop-art-visual-timeline.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="path-page">Pop-Art</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="pop-art-visual-timeline.html#timeline" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Visual Timeline</div></a></header><header id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd516-d511608f" class="title-block"><h1 class="title">Art History In Pictures</h1></header><section class="summary-block"><section class="callout"><div class="teaser"></div><h2 id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd525-d511608f" class="h2">Pop-Art&#x27;s Rise, Peak &amp; Legacy </h2><p class="paragraph-700">This is Pop-Art&#x27;s journey from a vibrant birth all the way to a transformative sunset. Explore iconic artworks that defined an era.</p></section><section class="in-page-links"><a href="pop-art-visual-timeline.html#body-01" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Pop-Art&#x27;s Vibrant Birth</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="pop-art-visual-timeline.html#body-02" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">The Peak and Controversy</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="pop-art-visual-timeline.html#body-03" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">The Sunset of Pop</div></a></section></section><header id="w-node-a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd54b-d511608f" class="break"><div data-w-id="a73bbd67-1541-8c9c-fd0e-5ef2bcfcd54c" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="header-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d4bace5a342dfc11a2c8_center-focused-ivy-growth-ui-page-break-animation.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></header></address><article id="body-01" class="section body-part"><h3 class="h3">Emergence of a Design Style</h3><div class="body-portion"><h4 id="w-node-ecda73c2-4ab9-e7d5-5079-5d39469ed78f-d511608f" class="h4-2">Pop-Art&#x27;s Vibrant Birth</h4><div class="paragraph-list w-richtext"><h2>What’s a Rich Text element?</h2><p>The rich text element allows you to create and format headings, paragraphs, blockquotes, images, and video all in one place instead of having to add and format them individually. Just double-click and easily create content.</p><h4>Static and dynamic content editing</h4><p>A rich text element can be used with static or dynamic content. For static content, just drop it into any page and begin editing. For dynamic content, add a rich text field to any collection and then connect a rich text element to that field in the settings panel. Voila!</p><h4>How to customize formatting for each rich text</h4><p>Headings, paragraphs, blockquotes, figures, images, and figure captions can all be styled after a class is added to the rich text element using the &quot;When inside of&quot; nested selector system.</p></div></div><div class="art-history"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d29477fe9209e57ab83_full.jasper-johns-flag-encaustic-on-canvas-new-york-1958.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Jasper Johns, &quot;Flag&quot;, Encaustic on canvas, New York, 1958." class="period-artwork"/><div class="image-attribution">Jas