e-_23fcfe40-aa89-79b5-417b-3cabe7f6bced-d5116019" style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="column peacock-anim"><div data-w-id="23fcfe40-aa89-79b5-417b-3cabe7f6bcef" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64daf55bb56ed775d9564a27_peacock-fan.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="introduction-art-history-bauhaus" class="header-subtext-group design-style"><h3 class="design-style-header">Made For The Unity</h3><div class="subtext">Conscious attempt to bring art and functionality together. </div></header><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Philosophy</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><p class="paragraph">Bauhaus is a modernist design movement that emphasizes aesthetics that aid in practicality.<br/></p><p class="paragraph">Emerging in the early 20th century, the core idea is that art and design need to be united in functionality. <br/></p></div></article><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Characteristics</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><div class="paragraph">It has had a profound influence on modern architecture and interior design. <br/></div><div class="paragraph">Bauhaus design is characterized by geometric shapes, simplicity, and the &quot;form follows function&quot; principle. <br/></div></div></article></section><section id="astro-fashion" style="opacity:0" class="cta"><div data-w-id="23fcfe40-aa89-79b5-417b-3cabe7f6bd0c" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1f0da194efeea8d9da_radiant-diamond-pair-left.lottie" data-loop="0" data