in-page-link">Concept Art</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="biophilic-design-coexist-nature.html#" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">More Styles</div></a></section></header></address><div id="w-node-eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9bed79-d511601a" style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="column peacock-anim"><div data-w-id="eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9bed7b" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64daf55bb56ed775d9564a27_peacock-fan.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="brief-art-history-introduction-biophilic-design" class="header-subtext-group design-style"><h3 class="design-style-header">Made For Actual Humans</h3><div class="subtext">Acknowledging we come from nature, not cement. </div></header><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Philosophy</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><p class="paragraph">Biophilic design draws inspiration from the natural world to create interior spaces that enhance well-being and connection to nature. <br/></p><p class="paragraph">In doing so it creates environments that reduce stress, improve productivity, and promote a sense of calm. It is rooted in the idea that humans have an innate affinity for nature, and by integrating these elements into our living spaces, we can improve our overall quality of life<br/></p></div></article><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Characteristics</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><div class="paragraph">Through architecture and interior designs, it seeks to bring the outdoors indoors. <br/></div><div class="paragraph">By incorporating elements such as plants, natural light, water features, and organic materials, Biophilic design beautifully achieves it&#x27;s goals. <br/></div></div></article></section><section id="astro-fashion" class="cta columns"><div data-w-id="eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9bed98" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1f0da194efeea8d9da_radiant-diamond-pair-left.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div><div class="cta-form"><h3 id="w-node-eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9bed9a-d511601a" class="form-cta-header yellow"> Style Updates</h3><div class="cta-message">Making sure you only receive relevant and interesting mail. <br/></div><div id="C1BA33A38-156" class="standard-form-block w-node-eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9bed9f-d511601a w-form"><form id="wf-form-C1BA33A38-156" name="wf-form-C1BA33A38-156" data-name="C1BA33A38-156" method="get" class="spectrum-updates-email" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d511601a" data-wf-element-id="eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9beda0"><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="C1BA33A38-156-name" data-name="C1BA33A38-156-name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="C1BA33A38-156-name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="C1BA33A38-156-phone" data-name="C1BA33A38-156-phone" placeholder="Email" type="email" id="C1BA33A38-156-phone" required=""/><select id="C1BA33A38-156-design-styles" name="C1BA33A38-156-design-styles" data-name="C1BA33A38-156-design-styles" required="" multiple="" class="w-node-eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9beda3-d511601a w-select"><option value="All New Design Style Articles">All New Design Style Articles</option><option value="Sustainable &amp; Eco-friendly Design">Sustainable &amp; Eco-friendly Design</option><option value="Biophilic Design">Biophilic Design</option><option value="Industrial Design">Industrial Design