on-paris-1925.jpeg 1200w"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="bauhaus.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Bauhaus</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Marcel Breuer, &quot;Wassily Chair&quot;, Tubular steel and fabric, Dessau, Germany, 1925." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d21477fe9209e57aa62_thumb.marcel-breuer-wassily-chair-tubular-steel-fabric-dessau-germany-1925.webp"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="scandinavian-design.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Scandinavian Design</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Hans J. Wegner, &quot;CH24 Wishbone Chair&quot;, Wood and natural cord, Denmark, 1950." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d1fd99e08ea2d63b0fe_thumb.hans-j-wegner-ch24-wishbone-chair-wood-natural-cord-denmark-1950.webp"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="brutalism.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Brutalism</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Le Corbusier, &quot;Unité d&#x27;Habitation&quot;, Reinforced concrete, Marseille, France, 1952." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d1e114038d73389b23c_thumb.le-corbusier-unite-dhabitation-reinforced-concrete-marseille-france-1952.webp"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="postmodernism.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Post-modernism</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Jeff Koons, &quot;Michael Jackson and Bubbles&quot;, Porcelain, New York, USA, 1988." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d1cee99da927457fd70_thumb.jeff-koons-michael-jackson-bubbles-porcelain-new-york-usa-1988.webp"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="industrial-design-renewed-popularity.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Industrial Design</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Eliot Noyes, &quot;Selectric Typewriter&quot;, Plastic and metal, New York, USA, 1961." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d1a2546910c930be367_thumb.eliot-noyes-selectric-typewriter-plastic-metal-new-york-usa-1961.webp"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="biophilic-design-coexist-nature.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Biophilic Design</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Renzo Piano, &quot;California Academy of Sciences&quot;, Architecture with living roof, San Francisco, USA, 2008." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d18aa7753db8385cf73_thumb.renzo-piano-ca-academy-architecture-living-roof-sf-usa-2008.webp"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_6b56b8b3-d89f-b515-174b-9097d74bb7e3-d511601a" role="listitem" class="column design-styles-art-history-features w-dyn-item"><a href="sustainable-eco-friendly.html" class="opaque-link-block w-inline-block"><h5 class="design-style-subheader design-style-article">Sustainable &amp; Eco-friendly</h5><img loading="lazy" alt="Ronald Rael and Virginia San Fratello, &quot;Mud Frontiers&quot;, 3D-printed mud structures, Southwestern USA, 2020." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/64db8d1659fa7d8ee204648b_thumb.rael-fratello-3d-printed-mud-structures-southwestern-usa-2020.webp"/></a></div></div></div></div></section></section><header class="section above-path"><div data-w-id="5b27be9e-e8f7-b9e7-fa26-9ede8401270e" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7d75deb70a956cf7fad2b_end-focused-ivy-growth-animation-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></header><header class="section half-margin"><header class="path"><a href="../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../the-style-spectrum.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">The Style Spectrum</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="biophilic-design-coexist-nature.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="path-page">Biophilic Design</div></a></header></header><footer style="opacity:0" class="footer"><aside class="form-block"><div id="C1BA33A38-157" class="standard-form-block w-form"><form id="wf-form-C1BA33A38-157" name="wf-form-C1BA33A38-157" data-name="C1BA33A38-157" method="get" class="footer-form" data-wf-page-id="64f5584e81052e45d511601a" data-wf-element-id="eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9bedec"><input class="form-field w-node-eb5ad429-9e00-c0bb-056b-a2ac8c9beded-d511601a w-input" maxlength="256" name="C1BA33A38-157-name" data-name="C1BA33A38-157-name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="C1BA33A38-157-name" required=""/><input class="form-field w-input" maxlength="256" name="C1BA33A38-157-email" data-name="C1BA33A38-157-email" placeholder="Email" type="email" id="C1BA33A38-157-email" required=""/><input type="submit" data-wait="Trending..." id="w-node-eb5ad429-9