3414e7a_rainbow-arch-menu-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></nav></header></div><address style="opacity:0" class="header-section"><header class="path"><a href="../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../the-style-spectrum.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">The Style Spectrum</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="industrial-design-renewed-popularity.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="path-page">Industrial Design</div></a></header><header id="w-node-ed73206b-1806-55f3-c3bd-ea82505c8866-d51160b2" class="art-divider"><div class="header-ui" data-w-id="ed73206b-1806-55f3-c3bd-ea82505c8867" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64f45656d38f6886e55da7eb_industrial-design-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div><h1 class="h1 hidden">Industrial Design</h1></header><header id="w-node-ed73206b-1806-55f3-c3bd-ea82505c886a-d51160b2" class="title-block"><div id="w-node-ed73206b-1806-55f3-c3bd-ea82505c886b-d51160b2" class="title-subtitle-group design-style"><h2 class="title">Celebrating Utilitarian Aesthetics</h2><div class="subtitle">Raw, functional, urban-inspired aesthetics.</div></div><section class="in-page-links"><a href="industrial-design-renewed-popularity.html#art-history-brief-introduction-industrial-design" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Brief Intro</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="industrial-design-renewed-popularity.html#industrial-design-art-history-articles" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Article Series</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="industrial-design-renewed-popularity.html#industrial-design-art-history-artist-interpretations" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Concept Art</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="industrial-design-renewed-popularity.html#" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">More Styles</div></a></section></header></address><div id="w-node-ed73206b-1806-55f3-c3bd-ea82505c8884-d51160b2" style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="column peacock-anim"><div data-w-id="ed73206b-1806-55f3-c3bd-ea82505c8886" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64daf55bb56ed775d9564a27_peacock-fan.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="art-history-brief-introduction-industrial-design" class="header-subtext-group design-style"><h3 class="design-style-header">Making Functional Fab</h3><div class="subtext">Not entirely helpful for progressing to more sustainable design. </div></header><article class="row-side-header"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Philosophy</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><p class="paragraph">Inspired by urban settings and factories, this design style embraces the functional and utilitarian aspects of objects and spaces. <br/></p><p class="paragraph">It&#x27;s characterized by its simplicity, clean lines, and a focus on functionality, making it a popular choice for contemporary, minimalist interiors that exude a rugged, urban charm. <br/></p></div></article><article class="row-side-header"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Characteristics</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><div class="paragraph">Industrial design is a bold and utilitarian style that celebrates the beauty of raw, unfinished aesthetics. <br/></div><div 