header></address><div id="w-node-_0d25cdcc-1d07-d7de-1356-c271a57405b0-d51160cb" style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="column peacock-anim"><div data-w-id="0d25cdcc-1d07-d7de-1356-c271a57405b2" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64daf55bb56ed775d9564a27_peacock-fan.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="maximalism-introduction-art-history" class="header-subtext-group center"><h3 class="design-style-header">Made For The Excess</h3><div class="subtext">The art of making excess not feel like clutter. </div></header><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Philosophy</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><p class="paragraph">Maximalism is an expressive design style that embraces excess. It is a balancing game, matching the unmatchable, and making the unsymmetrical layout feel symmetric. <br/></p></div></article><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Characteristics</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><div class="paragraph">Maximalist interiors are characterized by a sense of opulence and abundance. <br/></div><div class="paragraph">All about the excess, the design embraces vibrant colors, bold patterns, and a mix of styles to create visually rich and eclectic spaces. <br/></div></div></article></section><section id="astro-fashion" style="opacity:0" class="cta"><div data-w-id="0d25cdcc-1d07-d7de-1356-c271a57405cf" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64c7da1f0da194efeea8d9da_radiant-diamond-pair-left.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autopl