 data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div></nav></header></div><address style="opacity:0" class="header-section"><header class="path"><a href="../index.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">Home</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="../the-style-spectrum.html" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="path-page">The Style Spectrum</div></a><div class="path-page">  /  </div><a href="postmodernism.html" aria-current="page" class="url w-inline-block w--current"><div class="path-page">Postmodernism</div></a></header><header id="w-node-_223677c2-c9b6-3f02-ee65-5a8a115909d4-d51160e6" class="art-divider"><div class="header-ui" data-w-id="223677c2-c9b6-3f02-ee65-5a8a115909d5" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64f45656f762b614242a5b03_postmodernism-ui.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0"></div><h1 class="h1 hidden">Postmodernism</h1></header><header id="w-node-_223677c2-c9b6-3f02-ee65-5a8a115909d8-d51160e6" class="title-block"><div id="w-node-_223677c2-c9b6-3f02-ee65-5a8a115909d9-d51160e6" class="title-subtitle-group design-style"><h2 class="title">Breaking Design Conventions</h2><div class="subtitle">Playful, eclectic, deconstructing traditional norms.</div></div><section class="in-page-links"><a href="postmodernism.html#brief-introduction-art-history-postmodernism" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Brief Intro</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="postmodernism.html#art-history-postmodernism-articles" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Article Series</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="postmodernism.html#postmodernism-artist-interpretations" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">Concept Art</div></a><div class="in-page-link">   •    </div><a href="postmodernism.html#" class="url w-inline-block"><div class="in-page-link">More Styles</div></a></section></header></address><div id="w-node-_223677c2-c9b6-3f02-ee65-5a8a115909f2-d51160e6" style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="column peacock-anim"><div data-w-id="223677c2-c9b6-3f02-ee65-5a8a115909f4" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animated-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63eeb040bbd9e6ee6a1ef49e/64daf55bb56ed775d9564a27_peacock-fan.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-duration="0" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div><section style="opacity:0" class="section"><header id="brief-introduction-art-history-postmodernism" class="header-subtext-group design-style"><h3 class="design-style-header">Made For The Commentary</h3><div class="subtext">Rebel with a cause. </div></header><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Philosophy</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><p class="paragraph">Postmodernism is a design philosophy that revels in the playfulness of breaking away from traditional design conventions. <br/></p><p class="paragraph">It emerged in the latter half of the 20th century and often combines various design styles, creating eclectic and diverse spaces. <br/></p></div></article><article class="_2-column"><div class="column design-style-subheader"><h4 class="design-style-subheader">Characteristics</h4></div><div class="column design-feature-body"><div class="paragraph">Postmodern design can incorporate elements of irony, humor, and cultural references into its creations. <br/></div><div class="paragraph">It challenges the notion of a single, dominant design style and encourages the freedom to experiment and blend influences, resulting in visually intriguing and thought-provoking interiors and architecture<br/></div></div></article></section><section id="astro-fashion" class="cta columns"><div data-w-id="