"bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="fd0c4811-9f1b-3b4b-99a1-fa29d93d404b" alt="Child painting the clouds. Contemporary digital art, @seanivore 2023" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1a0b6fe57b91e02b090_home-child-cloud-painting.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1a0b6fe57b91e02b090_home-child-cloud-painting-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1a0b6fe57b91e02b090_home-child-cloud-painting-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1a0b6fe57b91e02b090_home-child-cloud-painting-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1a0b6fe57b91e02b090_home-child-cloud-painting.webp 1200w" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">Articulate design instead of just showing art.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Form and fortify our foundation for design and style.<br/></p><p class="paragraph">Learn the vocabulary and how to recognize the different visual influences.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="b4cc7871-8575-0a1b-84ff-3915d475ae9e" alt="People in a futuristic city do yoga on the rooftops. Silhouettes and sunset. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bec91da53cdd302a56d85_home-urban-yoga-encouraging.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bec91da53cdd302a56d85_home-urban-yoga-encouraging-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bec91da53cdd302a56d85_home-urban-yoga-encouraging-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bec91da53cdd302a56d85_home-urban-yoga-encouraging-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bec91da53cdd302a56d85_home-urban-yoga-encouraging.webp 1200w" class="window-image"/><main id="scandinavian-design" class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">Learn how to predict modern design trends — play an active role in shaping them.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">See the patterns in behavior.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Learn how to spot trend, how to see the evolution of style.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="90cf60a7-4c17-3ca0-f3e1-b116197884d6" alt="Pop-Art era art movement artists interpretation mural of an elderly woman. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651becb8ecf64d9a2c50d1a4_home-pop-art-contemporary-interpretation.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651becb8ecf64d9a2c50d1a4_home-pop-art-contemporary-interpretation-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651becb8ecf64d9a2c50d1a4_home-pop-art-contemporary-interpretation-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651becb8ecf64d9a2c50d1a4_home-pop-art-contemporary-interpretation-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651becb8ecf64d9a2c50d1a4_home-pop-art-contemporary-interpretation.webp 1200w" class="window-image"/><main id="brutalism" class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">To understand where today&#x27;s style is going next, we must look back.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Identifying shifts of art movements teaches one to discern patterns.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="5e6fad0e-43a5-32f4-7de8-85b1dab95788" alt="Swimsuit, beach, couple. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bece4d055d6e8940a1723_home-beach-oil-painting.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bece4d055d6e8940a1723_home-beach-oil-painting-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bece4d055d6e8940a1723_home-beach-oil-painting-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bece4d055d6e8940a1723_home-beach-oil-painting-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bece4d055d6e8940a1723_home-beach-oil-painting.webp 1200w" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">Art is an expression of human behavior, of emotion, painted in metaphor.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Metaphor that can only be unfolded by understanding the context.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Learning personality archetypes, as in astrology, provides context for modern human behavior; provides a vocabulary to better speak to human behavior.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="7c37b830-9c10-c30a-c7e3-c2d1244ee6bc" alt="Deer looking out of the woods. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1afb6fe57b91e02c1af_home-deer-rack-painting.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1afb6fe57b91e02c1af_home-deer-rack-painting-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1afb6fe57b91e02c1af_home-deer-rack-painting-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1afb6fe57b91e02c1af_home-deer-rack-painting-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bf1afb6fe57b91e02c1af_home-deer-rack-painting.webp 1200w" class="window-image"/><main class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">Astrology is the language of personality — of human behavior.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Astrology helps us see the metaphor, which helps us see the pattern.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">The pattern — or evolution, or trend — is essentially a manifestation of human behavior.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="f1ae8ab8-f7de-aca9-1f7f-f79b2ec8f55c" alt="Robots at a spa. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bed0af84be606f8f17265_home-self-care-quirky-android.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bed0af84be606f8f17265_home-self-care-quirky-android-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bed0af84be606f8f17265_home-self-care-quirky-android-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bed0af84be606f8f17265_home-self-care-quirky-android-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bed0af84be606f8f17265_home-self-care-quirky-android.webp 1200w" class="window-image"/><main id="biophilic" class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">After our look back, we look inside ourselves and each other.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">This platform serves as a bridge between the past and the present, the external and the internal.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">We&#x27;ve embraced modern technology, including the machine quite literally designed to interpret human behavior through archetypes and profiles.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="2a095dcb-5b1f-470e-4581-66b04901c2f0" alt="Woman on urban street. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street-p-2000.webp 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/651bef868244c77a2a32168e_home-urban-street.webp 2500w" class="window-image"/><main id="pop-art" class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">Our approach empowers anyone keen on making their mark in the world.</div></main></div><article style="opacity:0" class="section"><div class="spacer-text"><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">A recipe for success, whether your goal is creating trends or wellness or career progress.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story">Astrology is our guide telling us what to focus on and how to focus on it.<br/></p><p class="paragraph brand-story center-aligned">⁂<br/></p></div></article><div class="bleed-window"><img loading="lazy" data-w-id="870d5217-80cc-3a82-733d-fe2ee1916203" alt="Robots fighting through desert sands. " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/65114521d9d3260d5d15aa17_gpt-on-his-asto-expertise-1.webp" class="window-image"/><main id="postmodernism" class="bleed-window-wrapper"><div class="window-text brand-story">After we look at art, we look to the stars.</div></main></div></div></div></div></div><article class="section homepage end-brand-story"><div class="homepage end-brand-story w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-7 homepage brand-story-end w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column homepage end-of-brand-story w-dyn-item"><div class="_2-column home-page section-buttons"><a href="todays-astrology-readings.html" class="url realtive w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" alt="Contemporary digital art, @seanivore 2023" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/653038b546c25967bc510853_231016-2-section-astrofluenced.webp"/><div class="text-wrapper end-of-brand-story"><h3 class="over-image-text end-of-brand-story">Astrofluenced</h3></div></a><a href="the-style-spectrum.html" class="url realtive w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" alt="Contemporary digital art, @seanivore 2023" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f3ab1e1cf999fb30da882b/653038b546c25967bc510841_231016-2-section-design-spectrum.webp"/><div class="text-wrapper end-of-brand-story"><h3 class="over-image-text end-of-brand-story">The Style Spectrum</h3></div></a></div></div></div></div></article><section class="cta columns"><div id="w-node-f0adda7e-c1a8-96b0-ace8-cfe4cb5624ee-d5115ed7" data-w-id="f0adda7e-c1a8-96b0-ace8-cfe4cb5624ee" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="cta-ui" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="http